WHILE REFER FROM THIS POINT ON

00:06:14.474 --> 00:06:16.209
AS INTELLECTUAL DISABILITY.

00:06:16.676 --> 00:06:20.747
THE ABILITY TO PROVIDE EXPERT

00:06:20.813 --> 00:06:21.581
EVIDENCE

00:06:21.647 --> 00:06:23.516
THAT THEIR DEVELOPMENTAL

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:25.585
DISABILITY MANIFESTED PRIOR TO

00:06:25.651 --> 00:06:27.620
THE AGE OF 25.

00:06:27.687 --> 00:06:29.489
NOW, UNDER OUR CURRENT LAW,

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:32.058
IF YOU HAVE A DIAGNOSIS THAT

00:06:32.125 --> 00:06:34.527
THAT YOU HAD SUCH A DISABILITY

00:06:34.594 --> 00:06:36.562
BEFORE THE AGE OF 25,

00:06:36.629 --> 00:06:38.731
AND THAT DIAGNOSIS IS PRESENT

00:06:38.798 --> 00:06:41.067
WHEN YOU FACE A CONVICTION.

00:06:42.034 --> 00:06:44.403
YOU ARE INELIGIBLE FOR A DEATH

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:44.804
SENTENCE,

00:06:44.871 --> 00:06:46.806
AND THAT IS CONSISTENT WITH THE

00:06:46.873 --> 00:06:47.540
EIGHTH AMENDMENT.

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:50.943
BUT WE HAVE CIRCUMSTANCES WHERE

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:51.511
PEOPLE

00:06:51.577 --> 00:06:53.479
WITH THESE INTELLECTUAL

00:06:53.546 --> 00:06:54.147
DISABILITIES,

00:06:54.213 --> 00:06:55.782
FOR ANY NUMBER OF REASONS,

00:06:55.848 --> 00:06:58.284
DID NOT RECEIVE THAT DIAGNOSIS.

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:00.753
YOU COULD IMAGINE THAT PERSON

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:01.187
DIDN'T

00:07:01.254 --> 00:07:02.789
HAVE ACCESS TO HEALTH CARE.

00:07:02.855 --> 00:07:04.891
THEY WEREN'T AT SCHOOLS THAT DID

00:07:04.957 --> 00:07:05.591
SUCH TESTING.

00:07:05.658 --> 00:07:07.393
THERE'S ANY NUMBER OF REASONS

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:08.828
WHY THEY MAY NOT

00:07:08.895 --> 00:07:11.764
HAVE HAD THAT DIAGNOSIS BEFORE

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:14.167
THE AGE OF 25.

00:07:15.168 --> 00:07:18.304
NOW, THIS BILL DOES NOT CHANGE

00:07:18.371 --> 00:07:19.906
OUR CURRENT STATUTE IN

00:07:19.972 --> 00:07:22.508
THAT THE PRESENCE OF THE

00:07:22.575 --> 00:07:23.543
INTELLECTUAL DISABILITY

00:07:23.609 --> 00:07:25.344
OR THE DEVELOPMENTAL DISABILITY

00:07:25.411 --> 00:07:26.245
MUST HAVE

00:07:26.312 --> 00:07:27.980
BEEN PRESENT IN THE

00:07:28.047 --> 00:07:28.848
DEVELOPMENTAL PERIOD.

00:07:28.915 --> 00:07:30.783
SO IT MUST HAVE BEEN PRESENT

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.385
BEFORE THE AGE OF 25.

00:07:32.451 --> 00:07:35.154
MY BILL DOES NOT IN ANY WAY

00:07:35.221 --> 00:07:36.756
TOUCH OR THWART THAT.

00:07:36.823 --> 00:07:38.724
THAT IS STILL THE LAW.

00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:41.761
BUT WHAT IT DOES DO IS ALLOW,

00:07:41.828 --> 00:07:44.397
IF A PERSON CAN PROVIDE

00:07:44.463 --> 00:07:46.799
THE CREDIBLE EVIDENCE WITH

00:07:46.866 --> 00:07:47.400
EXPERTS

00:07:47.466 --> 00:07:49.502
WHO DO SUCH TESTING,

00:07:49.569 --> 00:07:51.470
MEDICAL AND OTHER EXPERTS,

00:07:51.537 --> 00:07:55.074
THEN THEY WOULD AVOID THE DEATH

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:55.675
PENALTY.

00:07:55.741 --> 00:07:57.410
THEY WOULD STILL HAVE LIFE

00:07:57.476 --> 00:07:58.110
WITHOUT PAROLE,

00:07:58.177 --> 00:08:00.179
BUT THEY WOULD NOT BE ABLE TO BE

00:08:00.246 --> 00:08:00.446
EXECUTED.

00:08:00.513 --> 00:08:02.281
NOW YOU MAY WONDER, WHY AM I

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:03.049
BRINGING THIS BILL?

00:08:03.115 --> 00:08:05.985
NOW WE HAVE A MORATORIUM ON

00:08:06.052 --> 00:08:06.485
EXECUTIONS,

00:08:06.552 --> 00:08:07.520
BUT THE FACT IS,

00:08:07.587 --> 00:08:09.488
THE DEATH PENALTY IS STILL LAW

00:08:09.555 --> 00:08:10.122
IN CALIFORNIA

00:08:10.189 --> 00:08:12.291
AND EXECUTIONS COULD BEGIN

00:08:12.358 --> 00:08:12.825
AGAIN.

00:08:12.892 --> 00:08:14.727
AND WHAT THIS DOES IS HELPS

00:08:14.794 --> 00:08:16.662
US ENSURE THAT CALIFORNIA

00:08:16.729 --> 00:08:18.297
IS CONSISTENT WITH THE EIGHTH

00:08:18.364 --> 00:08:18.631
AMENDMENT

00:08:18.698 --> 00:08:20.299
AND PROTECTS AGAINST THE

00:08:20.366 --> 00:08:21.534
EXECUTION OF PEOPLE

00:08:21.601 --> 00:08:23.402
WITH INTELLECTUAL DISABILITIES.

