00:11:33.793 --> 00:11:36.162
ACCORDING TO THE NATIONAL RETAIL

00:11:36.228 --> 00:11:36.695
FEDERATION.

00:11:37.897 --> 00:11:41.867
THERE IS THE MOST POPULAR GIFT

00:11:41.934 --> 00:11:43.335
