00:11:47.006 --> 00:11:47.640
BILLION

00:11:47.706 --> 00:11:50.109
SITTING IN UNUSED GIFT CARDS.

00:11:50.576 --> 00:11:52.711
THIS WILL UPDATE IT FOR

00:11:52.778 --> 00:11:54.980
THE FIRST TIME IN THE 16 YEARS.

00:11:55.047 --> 00:11:57.850
THERE HAVE BEEN A FEW ARGUMENTS

00:11:57.917 --> 00:11:58.851
