00:12:16.035 --> 00:12:17.369
WE HAVE RECEIVED NONE.

00:12:17.436 --> 00:12:19.939
IF WE RECEIVE ANY, WE WILL LOOK

00:12:20.005 --> 00:12:20.673
AT THIS.

00:12:20.739 --> 00:12:22.641
AND THERE'S ALSO CONCERN ABOUT A

00:12:22.708 --> 00:12:23.275
FEDERAL LIMIT.

00:12:23.342 --> 00:12:25.578
