00:12:25.644 --> 00:12:27.413
THAT HAS A LIMIT

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.148
THAT'S HIGHER THAN THE ONE IN

00:12:29.215 --> 00:12:29.715
THIS BILL.

00:12:29.782 --> 00:12:32.017
