00:42:11.829 --> 00:42:12.363
GOVERNMENTS

00:42:12.696 --> 00:42:14.331
AT A REGIONAL SCALE.

00:42:14.398 --> 00:42:17.001
SINCE COMING INTO SERVICE IN

00:42:17.067 --> 00:42:17.534
2017,

00:42:17.601 --> 00:42:19.470
SMART HAS OVERCOME WILDFIRES,

00:42:19.536 --> 00:42:21.672
FLOODS AND A GLOBAL PANDEMIC

00:42:21.739 --> 00:42:22.106
THAT

00:42:22.172 --> 00:42:23.741
DEVASTATED PUBLIC TRANSIT.

00:42:23.807 --> 00:42:25.242
DESPITE THOSE OBSTACLES, THEY

00:42:25.309 --> 00:42:25.976
KEEP CHUGGING

00:42:26.043 --> 00:42:28.379
ALONG AND AT THE END OF 2023,

00:42:28.445 --> 00:42:29.980
BECAME THE FIRST TRANSIT SYSTEM

00:42:30.047 --> 00:42:31.548
IN THE BAY AREA TO

00:42:31.615 --> 00:42:33.817
RECOVER TO THEIR PRE-PANDEMIC

00:42:33.884 --> 00:42:34.952
RIDERSHIP NUMBERS.

00:42:35.019 --> 00:42:36.420
