00:44:44.548 --> 00:44:45.082
THE SAME THING,

00:44:45.149 --> 00:44:46.083
TO PROVIDE HEAT,

00:44:46.150 --> 00:44:47.785
TO RUN THEIR PROCESSES WITH

00:44:47.851 --> 00:44:48.485
CLEAN ELECTRICITY

00:44:48.552 --> 00:44:50.287
RATHER THAN FOSSIL FUELS.

00:44:50.354 --> 00:44:53.857
OUR SCOPING PLAN PREDICTS TEN

00:44:53.924 --> 00:44:54.558
GIGAWATTS

00:44:54.625 --> 00:44:55.959
OF HYDROGEN PRODUCTION

00:44:56.026 --> 00:44:57.895
POWERED DIRECTLY FROM OFF GRID

00:44:57.961 --> 00:44:58.262
RENEWABLES.

00:44:58.328 --> 00:44:59.463
BUT THERE IS A PROBLEM.

00:44:59.530 --> 00:45:01.432
YOU CANNOT DO THIS TODAY BECAUSE

00:45:01.498 --> 00:45:02.099
OF SOMETHING

00:45:02.166 --> 00:45:03.801
CALLED THE OVER THE FENCE RULE.

00:45:03.867 --> 00:45:05.302
THIS RULE SAYS THAT IF YOU SELL

00:45:05.369 --> 00:45:05.936
POWER TO ANYONE,

00:45:06.003 --> 00:45:07.304
YOU MUST BE REGULATED AS A

00:45:07.371 --> 00:45:07.738
PUBLIC UTILITY,

00:45:07.805 --> 00:45:10.174
WHICH WOULD KILL ANY PROJECT.

00:45:10.240 --> 00:45:12.409
THERE ARE A FEW EXEMPTIONS TO

00:45:12.476 --> 00:45:13.911
THIS LIMITED TO POWER

00:45:13.977 --> 00:45:16.146
PRODUCED ON THE SAME PROPERTY AS

00:45:16.213 --> 00:45:16.880
THE BUYER,

00:45:16.947 --> 00:45:18.415
OR A SINGLE ADJACENT PROPERTY,

00:45:18.482 --> 00:45:20.951
HENCE THE NAME OVER THE FENCE

00:45:21.018 --> 00:45:21.452
RULE.

00:45:21.685 --> 00:45:23.087
THE PROBLEM IS THAT TO GENERATE

00:45:23.153 --> 00:45:23.554
ENOUGH POWER

00:45:23.620 --> 00:45:25.189
TO PRODUCE HYDROGEN OR ELECTRIFY

00:45:25.255 --> 00:45:25.522
FACTORY,

00:45:25.589 --> 00:45:26.857
YOU NEED A LOT MORE SPACE FOR

00:45:26.924 --> 00:45:27.424
SOLAR OR WIND

00:45:27.491 --> 00:45:29.793
THAN JUST A SINGLE ADJACENT

00:45:29.860 --> 00:45:30.327
PROPERTY.

00:45:30.627 --> 00:45:32.663
SB 1018 SOLVES THIS PROBLEM BY

00:45:32.729 --> 00:45:34.298
ALLOWING A LARGE SOLAR OR WIND

00:45:34.364 --> 00:45:36.233
FARM TO SELL THEIR OUTPUT

00:45:36.300 --> 00:45:36.633
DIRECTLY

00:45:36.700 --> 00:45:38.435
TO A SINGLE CUSTOMER,

00:45:38.502 --> 00:45:40.137
WHO WILL USE THAT POWER FOR

00:45:40.204 --> 00:45:40.704
PRODUCING HYDROGEN

00:45:40.771 --> 00:45:42.906
OR PROVIDING INDUSTRIAL HEAT.

00:45:42.973 --> 00:45:44.641
BY LIMITING THIS EXEMPTION TO

00:45:44.708 --> 00:45:44.975
ALLOW

00:45:45.042 --> 00:45:46.543
SALES TO A SINGLE CUSTOMER,

00:45:46.610 --> 00:45:48.312
WE ARE KEEPING THE CONSUMER

00:45:48.378 --> 00:45:48.679
PROTECTIONS

00:45:48.745 --> 00:45:50.581
UNDER CURRENT LAW IN PLACE.

00:45:50.647 --> 00:45:51.915
