01:27:21.269 --> 01:27:23.237
WHICH WOULD MAKE CALIFORNIA THE

01:27:23.304 --> 01:27:24.038
PIONEERING STATE

01:27:24.105 --> 01:27:25.640
TO RECOGNIZE INTERSECTIONALITY

01:27:25.707 --> 01:27:26.708
IN OUR

01:27:26.774 --> 01:27:28.943
CIVIL RIGHTS LAWS BY CLARIFYING

01:27:29.010 --> 01:27:30.511
THAT DISCRIMINATION IS

01:27:30.578 --> 01:27:31.546
PROHIBITED NOT

01:27:31.613 --> 01:27:33.748
ONLY BECAUSE OF ONE PROTECTED

01:27:33.815 --> 01:27:34.182
TRAIT,

01:27:34.248 --> 01:27:36.451
BUT BY ANY COMBINATION OF TWO

01:27:36.517 --> 01:27:38.286
OR MORE PROTECTED TRAITS.

01:27:38.353 --> 01:27:40.121
UNDER CURRENT LAW, ALL

01:27:40.188 --> 01:27:40.588
INDIVIDUALS

01:27:40.655 --> 01:27:42.123
ARE PROTECTED FROM

01:27:42.190 --> 01:27:42.624
DISCRIMINATION,

01:27:42.690 --> 01:27:44.759
BUT THESE CASES ARE EXACERBATED

01:27:44.826 --> 01:27:46.060
WHEN AN INDIVIDUAL

01:27:46.127 --> 01:27:47.829
HAS EXPERIENCED DISCRIMINATION

01:27:47.895 --> 01:27:50.665
BASED ON A COMBINATION OF

01:27:50.732 --> 01:27:51.232
INTERSECTIONS

01:27:51.299 --> 01:27:52.600
OF PROTECTED CLASSES.

01:27:52.667 --> 01:27:54.769
FOR EXAMPLE, WHEN A BLACK WOMAN

01:27:54.836 --> 01:27:55.136
BRINGS

01:27:55.203 --> 01:27:57.338
FORWARD A DISCRIMINATION CASE,

01:27:57.405 --> 01:27:59.607
SHE MAY BE FORCED TO ADDRESS HER

01:27:59.674 --> 01:27:59.941
RACE

01:28:00.008 --> 01:28:02.210
AND GENDER CLAIMS SEPARATELY.

01:28:02.276 --> 01:28:04.312
IN CASES WHERE INTERSECTIONAL

01:28:04.379 --> 01:28:05.380
DISCRIMINATION OCCURS,

01:28:05.446 --> 01:28:07.382
THE DEFENSE MAY ATTEMPT TO USE

01:28:07.448 --> 01:28:08.383
THE SEPARATION OF

01:28:08.449 --> 01:28:10.752
CHARACTERISTICS TO DEFEAT THE

01:28:10.818 --> 01:28:11.953
CLAIM ENTIRELY.

01:28:12.020 --> 01:28:13.721
COURTS THROUGHOUT THE NATION

01:28:13.788 --> 01:28:15.256
HAVE RULED ON THESE CASES,

01:28:15.323 --> 01:28:17.425
AND CONSISTENTLY AND LARGELY

01:28:17.492 --> 01:28:19.661
ON A CASE BY CASE BASIS.

01:28:19.727 --> 01:28:20.962
THE INTERSECTIONAL

01:28:21.029 --> 01:28:21.596
DISCRIMINATION

01:28:21.663 --> 01:28:23.097
IS NOT LIMITED TO RACE,

01:28:23.164 --> 01:28:25.333
AND GENDER DISCRIMINATION CAN BE

01:28:25.400 --> 01:28:27.402
EXPRESSED BASED ON ONE'S AGE,

01:28:27.468 --> 01:28:29.704
RACE, NATIONAL ORIGIN, OR ANY

01:28:29.771 --> 01:28:33.041
COMBINATION OF SUCH CLASSES.

01:28:33.107 --> 01:28:35.910
THOSE OF US WHO LIVE AT THE

01:28:35.977 --> 01:28:36.310
INTERSECTIONS

01:28:36.377 --> 01:28:38.246
OF MULTIPLE PROTECTED CLASSES

01:28:38.312 --> 01:28:40.782
KNOW THAT THESE EXPERIENCES CAN

01:28:40.848 --> 01:28:41.282
ALL

01:28:41.349 --> 01:28:43.484
CANNOT ALWAYS BE NEATLY

01:28:43.551 --> 01:28:44.018
SEPARATED.

01:28:44.085 --> 01:28:46.854
WE ARE ONE WHOLE SELF, AND WE

01:28:46.921 --> 01:28:47.655
CARRY ALL

01:28:47.722 --> 01:28:49.957
OF OUR IDENTITIES WITH US AT ALL

01:28:50.024 --> 01:28:50.291
TIMES.

01:28:50.358 --> 01:28:52.260
AND IT IS NECESSARY THAT OUR

01:28:52.326 --> 01:28:53.227
