THIS BILL DOES NOT LIMIT

01:35:37.364 --> 01:35:38.399
COMMERCIAL RENT OR

01:35:38.466 --> 01:35:40.101
IMPOSE ANY FORM OF COMMERCIAL

01:35:40.167 --> 01:35:40.801
