BRAIN DATA.

01:37:43.657 --> 01:37:45.159
UH, AND IF THAT SOUNDS

01:37:45.226 --> 01:37:45.459
FUTURISTIC,

01:37:45.526 --> 01:37:46.560
I CAN TELL YOU EVERYONE WHO

01:37:46.627 --> 01:37:48.462
WAS IN A JUDICIARY COMMITTEE

01:37:48.529 --> 01:37:48.829
THAT

01:37:48.896 --> 01:37:51.232
DAY LISTENING TO MY EXPERTS,

01:37:51.298 --> 01:37:52.866
INCLUDING RAFA USTA, WHO

01:37:52.933 --> 01:37:53.667
INSPIRED PRESIDENT

01:37:53.734 --> 01:37:56.036
OBAMA'S BRAIN INITIATIVE,

01:37:56.103 --> 01:37:57.638
EVERYBODY WAS PAYING RAPT

01:37:57.705 --> 01:37:58.038
ATTENTION.

01:37:58.105 --> 01:37:59.039
NOBODY WAS ON THEIR PHONES.

01:37:59.106 --> 01:38:01.242
NOBODY WAS READING ANYTHING BUT

01:38:01.308 --> 01:38:02.142
PAYING ATTENTION

01:38:02.209 --> 01:38:05.112
TO HEAR HIM TALK ABOUT HIS

01:38:05.179 --> 01:38:06.080
OPPENHEIMER MOMENT,

01:38:06.146 --> 01:38:08.048
WHEN HE REALIZED THAT HE WAS

01:38:08.115 --> 01:38:08.716
ABLE TO

01:38:08.782 --> 01:38:10.751
NOT JUST READ THE THOUGHTS OF

01:38:10.818 --> 01:38:11.085
MICE,

01:38:11.151 --> 01:38:13.887
BUT TO IMPLANT THOUGHTS INTO

01:38:13.954 --> 01:38:14.521
MICE.

01:38:15.222 --> 01:38:17.658
SO THIS IS NOT SCIENCE FICTION.

01:38:18.058 --> 01:38:20.494
UM, AND A LOT OF THIS RESEARCH

01:38:20.561 --> 01:38:23.631
IS HAPPENING HERE IN OUR AREA,

01:38:23.697 --> 01:38:25.266
AND THE EXPERTS THEMSELVES ARE

01:38:25.332 --> 01:38:27.568
THE ONES RAISING THE RED FLAG ON

01:38:27.635 --> 01:38:27.968
THIS.

01:38:28.569 --> 01:38:30.838
THERE'S BEEN ABOUT $19 BILLION

01:38:30.904 --> 01:38:31.772
INVESTED GLOBALLY

01:38:31.839 --> 01:38:33.807
IN OVER 200 NEUROSCIENCE

01:38:33.874 --> 01:38:34.308
COMPANIES,

01:38:34.375 --> 01:38:37.311
INCLUDING A WRISTBAND THAT WILL

01:38:37.378 --> 01:38:39.580
ATTEMPT TO TRANSLATE, UM,

01:38:39.980 --> 01:38:42.216
INFORMATION ABOUT INTENTIONS

01:38:42.283 --> 01:38:45.819
AND GESTURES FROM YOUR WRIST.

01:38:45.886 --> 01:38:48.489
SO, UH, INVASIVE TECHNOLOGIES

01:38:48.555 --> 01:38:49.823
LIKE YOU'VE

01:38:49.890 --> 01:38:52.259
HEARD OF MAYBE ELON MUSK'S

01:38:52.326 --> 01:38:52.726
NEURALINK,

01:38:52.793 --> 01:38:54.194
INVASIVE DEVICES LIKE THAT

01:38:54.261 --> 01:38:54.928
ACTUALLY ARE

01:38:54.995 --> 01:38:57.264
ALREADY REGULATED AS MEDICAL

01:38:57.331 --> 01:38:57.831
DEVICES.

01:38:57.898 --> 01:39:00.534
HOWEVER, THERE ARE NOW OVER 30

01:39:00.601 --> 01:39:02.336
CLASS OF NEUROTECH COMPANIES

01:39:02.403 --> 01:39:04.872
THAT ARE DOING NON-INVASIVE

01:39:04.938 --> 01:39:06.140
NEUROTECH PRODUCTS.

01:39:06.206 --> 01:39:09.710
THESE DEVICES RECORD BRAIN DATA

01:39:09.777 --> 01:39:11.845
USING EEG SENSORS,

01:39:11.912 --> 01:39:13.147
BUT BECAUSE THEY'RE NOT

01:39:13.213 --> 01:39:14.114
CONSIDERED MEDICAL DEVICES,

01:39:14.181 --> 01:39:16.650
THEY'RE THEY'RE NOT SO TIGHTLY

01:39:16.717 --> 01:39:17.151
REGULATED.

01:39:17.217 --> 01:39:18.919
SO THAT ALLOWS COMPANIES TO

01:39:18.986 --> 01:39:19.987
COLLECT AND SELL

01:39:20.054 --> 01:39:22.222
USER DATA WITHOUT CONSUMER

01:39:22.289 --> 01:39:22.790
PERMISSION.

01:39:22.856 --> 01:39:23.891
AND THERE'S JUST A RECENT

01:39:23.957 --> 01:39:24.792
ANALYSIS OF THE PRIVACY

01:39:24.858 --> 01:39:27.161
POLICIES OF ALL OF THESE

01:39:27.227 --> 01:39:27.628
COMPANIES.

01:39:27.695 --> 01:39:28.929
AND YES, THEY HAVE THE RIGHT TO

01:39:28.996 --> 01:39:29.296
DO WHATEVER

01:39:29.363 --> 01:39:30.397
THEY WANT WITH BRAIN DATA.

01:39:30.464 --> 01:39:33.000
IN ALMOST ALL CASES, UM, AND THE

01:39:33.067 --> 01:39:33.367
CCPA

01:39:33.434 --> 01:39:34.902
PROTECTS PERSONAL INFORMATION,

01:39:34.968 --> 01:39:36.537
BUT AGAIN, IT DOESN'T COVER

01:39:36.603 --> 01:39:37.171
NEURAL DATA.

01:39:37.237 --> 01:39:38.539
SO WHAT THIS BILL WILL DO WILL

01:39:38.605 --> 01:39:39.306
MAKE SURE THAT NEURAL

01:39:39.373 --> 01:39:43.744
DATA IS COVERED BY OUR CCPA BY

01:39:43.811 --> 01:39:44.378
DEFINING

01:39:44.445 --> 01:39:46.480
AND CLASSIFYING IT AS SENSITIVE

01:39:46.547 --> 01:39:47.314
PERSONAL INFORMATION

01:39:47.381 --> 01:39:49.650
AND EXTENDING CCPA PROTECTIONS

01:39:49.717 --> 01:39:51.452
TO NEURAL DATA.

01:39:52.286 --> 01:39:53.654
REGULATING NEURAL TECHNOLOGY

01:39:53.721 --> 01:39:54.121
EARLY

01:39:54.188 --> 01:39:55.823
IS CRUCIAL TO ENSURE ETHICAL

01:39:55.889 --> 01:39:56.156
USE,

01:39:56.223 --> 01:39:57.791
PROTECT PRIVACY, ESTABLISH

01:39:57.858 --> 01:39:58.325
STANDARDS,

01:39:58.392 --> 01:40:00.928
AND ADDRESS FUTURE CHALLENGES.

01:40:00.994 --> 01:40:01.929
AGAIN, IF YOU HAVEN'T HEARD

01:40:01.995 --> 01:40:02.329
