03:57:44.850 --> 03:57:46.752
BY RACIALLY MOTIVATED REASONS

03:57:46.819 --> 03:57:48.687
AND NO OTHER REASON.

03:57:48.754 --> 03:57:50.956
MANY PEOPLE ARE NOW FAMILIAR

03:57:51.023 --> 03:57:52.291
