03:58:01.734 --> 03:58:03.836
OF CHARLES AND WILLA BRUCE,

03:58:03.902 --> 03:58:05.337
A FAMILY THAT HAD PURCHASED

03:58:05.404 --> 03:58:07.006
THIS PROPERTY IN 1912 WITH

03:58:07.072 --> 03:58:08.841
