03:58:08.907 --> 03:58:09.775
CAFE, A LODGE,

03:58:09.842 --> 03:58:11.443
AND AN OPPORTUNITY FOR

03:58:11.510 --> 03:58:11.877
AFRICAN-AMERICANS

03:58:11.944 --> 03:58:13.145
TO ENJOY BEACH LIFE

03:58:13.212 --> 03:58:14.713
JUST LIKE ANYONE ELSE IN

03:58:14.780 --> 03:58:15.014
CALIFORNIA

03:58:15.080 --> 03:58:16.348
AND ACROSS THIS NATION.

03:58:16.415 --> 03:58:18.651
