03:58:26.592 --> 03:58:27.993
TIME JUST AS THEY

03:58:28.060 --> 03:58:29.762
DID AND WANTED TO PUT THEM OUT

03:58:29.828 --> 03:58:30.262
OF BUSINESS.

03:58:30.329 --> 03:58:31.797
THE CITY USED THE POWER OF

03:58:31.864 --> 03:58:32.064
EMINENT

03:58:32.131 --> 03:58:34.166
DOMAIN TO TAKE THE BRUCE'S LAND,

03:58:34.233 --> 03:58:37.436
AND DO SO FOR FAR LESS THAN FAIR

03:58:37.503 --> 03:58:38.270
MARKET VALUE.

03:58:38.337 --> 03:58:40.673
AGAIN, IN 2022, I AUTHORED

03:58:40.739 --> 03:58:41.640
LEGISLATION THAT

03:58:41.707 --> 03:58:43.609
ALLOWED THE CURRENT OWNERS TO LA

03:58:43.676 --> 03:58:44.009
COUNTY.

