03:58:50.416 --> 03:58:52.418
JUST LIKE BRUCE'S BEACH.

03:58:53.085 --> 03:58:55.554
SB 1050 WILL PROVIDE A PATHWAY

03:58:55.621 --> 03:58:58.357
TO JUSTICE FOR OTHERS HARMED

03:58:58.424 --> 03:59:00.025
