07:29:23.102 --> 07:29:24.170
ALTERNATIVE TREATMENTS BESIDES

07:29:24.237 --> 07:29:25.271
THE JAIL SYSTEM,

07:29:25.338 --> 07:29:26.506
WHICH IS REALLY THE WORST PLACE

07:29:26.572 --> 07:29:28.274
TO PUT SOMEONE WHO'S SUFFERING

07:29:28.341 --> 07:29:29.575
SEVERE MENTAL ILLNESS OTHER THAN

07:29:29.642 --> 07:29:30.610
BACK ON THE STREET.

